<title>USA: U.S. stock index futures remain higher at midday.</title>
<headline>U.S. stock index futures remain higher at midday.</headline>
<text>
<p>Aug 6 - U.S. stock index futures remained higher at midday. Sept S&amp;Ps pulled off highs in-line with action in U.S. T-bond market, traders said. Sept held above 962.00, and could re-test the record high of 965.40 later in the afternoon. Volume for Sept is estimated at 32,000 contracts.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk, 312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: chicago.derivatives.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
